      "message": "[BLOCKING] `autoroll-be` overwrote the entire `infra/bots/deps/deps_gen.go` Go file with the raw revision hash `e2af388a840c95959617a9d3e6bda280e71fada6`, breaking Go compilation. Root cause: `skia-infra-public/agents-skia.cfg` (and `skia-infra-corp/agents-internal-skia.cfg`, added in https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia-autoroll-internal-config/+/1254819) specifies `file: { path: \"infra/bots/deps/deps_gen.go\" }` without a `regex` field, causing `autoroll` to treat the file as a plain-text version file instead of updating the `Version` field in-place. `agents-skia.cfg` needs `regex: \"\\\"chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/agents\\\":[^{]*\\\\{\\\\s*Id:\\\\s*\\\"[^\\\"]+\\\",\\\\s*Version:\\\\s*\\\"([a-f0-9]+)\\\"\"` (and `agents-internal-skia.cfg` needs the corresponding `chrome-internal.googlesource.com/chrome/agents-internal` regex, matching `dawn-skia.cfg`).",
